sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant G as Gateway
    participant T as text-channel
    participant S as server
    participant M as MongoDB Atlas
    participant R as Redis

    C->>G: WebSocket /api/ws/channels/42
    G->>T: relay del WS + X-User-Id
    T-->>C: conexión aceptada
    C->>T: frame send_message
    T->>S: GET /internal/channels/42/send-permission
    Note over T,S: X-Internal-Token · caché 5 s · fail-closed
    S-->>T: allow
    T->>M: inserta el mensaje
    T->>R: publish al topic del canal
    R-->>T: fan-out a todas las réplicas
    T-->>C: frame message a cada conectado